{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nマンモスフリーマーケットでライブでした＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年連続出させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったかた\nありがとうございました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく、今日のセトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycle\nぐるぐるカーテン\n狼に口笛を\n左胸の勇気\n春のメロディー\n会いたかったかもしれない\nおいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『春のメロディー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月19日発売4th singleの\nアンダーの曲です！\n今日、初披露でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/3971531/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ可愛い曲です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂らしい感じです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの乃木坂の曲より\nフォーメーションチェンジが多いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビの始めでいきなり後ろ向きで..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/3971531/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\nセンターに立たせてもらってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいところをもってて\n本当にすみません○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたく\nこの位置を全うさせていただきます｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装はこんな感じ！\n3色あるけど、中田は紫だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/3971531/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ終わってすぐ撮ったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪ぼさぼさだし\n滝汗(ｃ)だし\n自然チークだし(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい\n全力で楽しくできました！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長野、岡山、そして今回の愛知\nとライブをいろんな所でやらせていただきましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべて来てくださったかたも\n何人もいますよね(*゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\nほんとにありがとうございます○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ楽しい(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/3971531/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"team紫！\nみんな紫衣装だよ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした会えるかたは\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/3971531/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか会えないみなさんも\nまた会える日を待ってますね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}